      "items": [
        {
          "h2": "VP of Marketing at Zafran Security",
          "body": [
            {
              "text": "Nick Fisher is the VP of Marketing at Zafran Security.",
              "claimIds": [
                "zaf-038",
                "zaf-157"
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "He is a full-stack B2B marketing leader with experience building teams for early-stage growth and post-IPO scale.",
              "claimIds": [
                "zaf-044"
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "His background includes previous VP Product Marketing roles at Sysdig and Senior Director Product Marketing at Okta.",
              "claimIds": [
                "zaf-045"
              ]
            }
          ],
          "contactRefs": [
            {
              "name": "Nick Fisher"
            }
          ],
          "priority": 2
        },
        {
          "h2": "Growth-oriented marketing leader",
          "body": [
            {
              "text": "Nick Fisher is a \"full-stack B2B marketing leader / storyteller with experience building teams for early stage growth and post-IPO scale\".",
              "claimIds": [
                "zaf-044"
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "His career includes significant product marketing experience at companies like Sysdig and Okta.",
              "claimIds": [
                "zaf-045"
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "He also holds an MBA from Columbia Business School.",
              "claimIds": [
                "zaf-046"
              ]
            }
          ],
          "contactRefs": [
            {
              "name": "Nick Fisher"
            }
          ],
          "priority": 2
        },
        {
          "h2": "Active on LinkedIn, shares company POV",
          "body": [
            {
              "text": "Nick Fisher recently published an article on LinkedIn titled \"Why I joined Zafran Security,\" outlining his rationale and framing the market problem.",
              "claimIds": [
                "zaf-158",
                "zaf-167"
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "In the article, he states that Zafran revealed \"how 96% of vulnerabilities didn’t require patching and can be mitigated using existing controls.\"",
              "claimIds": [
                "zaf-159",
                "zaf-167"
              ]
            }
          ],
          "contactRefs": [
            {
              "name": "Nick Fisher"
            }
          ],
          "priority": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "problem_now",
      "empty": false,
      "items": [
        {
          "h2": "Building ABM from scratch",
          "body": [
            {
              "text": "Zafran Security is \"being built from scratch\" in terms of its ABM program.",
              "claimIds": [
                "zaf-090"
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "The company is actively hiring a Senior Manager, ABM & Integrated Campaigns to own ABM from the ground up, defining account tiers and go-to-market strategies.",
              "claimIds": [
                "zaf-090"
              ]
            }
          ],
          "sendLine": "In your email: Zafran Security is building its ABM program from scratch and hiring for an ABM Manager.",
          "priority": 1
        },
        {
          "h2": "Frustrated by noisy scanners and manual triage",
          "body": [
            {
              "text": "Zafran Security addresses customer frustration with noisy scanners and manual triage, claiming to \"normalize and de-duplicate findings\".",
              "claimIds": [
                "zaf-136",
                "zaf-149"
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "They position their platform as a replacement for legacy scanners, providing continuous detection with no new agents required.",
              "claimIds": [
                "zaf-136"
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "The company also claims to provide a single source of truth across cloud, on-prem, and AppSec.",
              "claimIds": [
                "zaf-149"
              ]
            }
          ],
          "sendLine": "In your email: Customers are frustrated with noisy scanners and manual triage, and Zafran Security aims to solve this by normalizing and de-duplicating findings.",
          "priority": 2
        },
        {
          "h2": "Scaling rapidly to meet demand",
          "body": [
            {
              "text": "Zafran Security cites rapid AI development driving significant hiring needs across engineering, sales, customer success, and core infrastructure to scale and meet demand.",
              "claimIds": [
                "zaf-129"
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "The company has 27 open requisitions, with 11 in Sales and 8 in R&D.",
              "claimIds": [
                "zaf-088"
              ]
            }
          ],
          "sendLine": "In your email: Zafran Security is rapidly scaling and hiring across multiple departments to meet demand, with 27 open roles.",
          "priority": 1
        },
        {
          "h2": "Establishing a partner channel from zero",
          "body": [
            {
              "text": "Zafran Security is actively \"standing up a partner/alliances channel from zero\".",
              "claimIds": [
                "zaf-091"
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "They are hiring a Director of Alliances to build this engine from scratch, focusing on Global Systems Integrators, cloud partners, and technology partners.",
              "claimIds": [
                "zaf-091"
              ]
            }
          ],
          "sendLine": "In your email: Zafran Security is building its partner and alliances channel from the ground up, and is hiring for a Director of Alliances.",
          "priority": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "openers",
      "empty": false,
      "items": [
        {
          "h2": "You're building Zafran's ABM program from scratch",
          "body": [
            {
              "text": "Zafran Security is currently in the process of building its ABM program from the ground up.",
              "claimIds": [
                "zaf-090"
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "They are looking for a Senior Manager, ABM & Integrated Campaigns to define account tiers and develop coordinated go-to-market strategies.",
              "claimIds": [
                "zaf-090"
              ]
            }
          ],
          "sendLine": "In your email: I saw Zafran Security is building its ABM program from scratch and hiring for an ABM Manager – a critical role for driving growth.",
          "priority": 1
        },
        {
          "h2": "Found a great recipe for a Moscow Mule",
          "body": [
            {
              "text": "Nick Fisher shares his expertise on cocktail creation, including a specific technique for Moscow Mules.",
              "claimIds": [
                "zaf-105"
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "He prefers using a homemade spicy ginger syrup over standard ginger beer for a superior taste.",
              "claimIds": [
                "zaf-105"
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "He also mentions learning from Greg Seider's book for the best ginger syrup recipe.",
              "claimIds": [
                "zaf-106"
              ]
            }
          ],
          "sendLine": "In your email: I heard you have a great recipe for a Moscow Mule using a homemade spicy ginger syrup – sounds delicious!",
          "priority": 2
        },
        {
          "h2": "You're building Zafran's partner channel from zero",
          "body": [
            {
              "text": "Zafran Security is establishing its partner and alliances channel from scratch.",
              "claimIds": [
                "zaf-091"
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "They are hiring a Director of Alliances to lead this initiative, focusing on GSI, cloud, and technology partners.",
              "claimIds": [
                "zaf-091"
              ]
            }
          ],
          "sendLine": "In your email: I noticed Zafran Security is building its partner channel from zero and hiring a Director of Alliances – a key strategic move.",
          "priority": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "angles",
      "empty": false,
      "items": [
        {
          "h2": "Landing Page: Showcase Zafran's unique value proposition",
          "body": [
            {
              "text": "Zafran Security positions itself as the first AI-native end-to-end Threat Exposure Management platform.",
              "claimIds": [
                "zaf-122"
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "The platform proves what attackers can exploit and mobilizes existing defenses to stop them, de-risking 90% of critical vulnerabilities overnight.",
              "claimIds": [
                "zaf-127",
                "zaf-148"
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "Zafran integrates with existing security tools and routes remediation through platforms like Jira and ServiceNow.",
              "claimIds": [
                "zaf-140",
                "zaf-147"
              ]
            }
          ],
          "sendLine": "On the landing page: Highlight Zafran's AI-native approach to Threat Exposure Management, emphasizing how it proves exploitability and uses existing tools for remediation, reducing critical vulnerabilities by 90% overnight.",
          "priority": 1
        },
        {
          "h2": "Direct Mail: Focus on solving noisy scanner frustration",
          "body": [
            {
              "text": "Zafran Security aims to alleviate customer frustration with \"noisy scanners and manual triage\".",
              "claimIds": [
                "zaf-136"
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "Their platform helps to \"normalize and de-duplicate findings\" from various sources, creating a single source of truth.",
              "claimIds": [
                "zaf-136",
                "zaf-149"
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "This directly addresses the pain point of dealing with overwhelming and often redundant vulnerability data.",
              "claimIds": [
                "zaf-136",
                "zaf-149"
              ]
            }
          ],
          "sendLine": "In the direct-mail brief: Emphasize Zafran's solution to the common frustration of noisy vulnerability scanners and manual triage, highlighting how the platform normalizes and de-duplicates findings for a single source of truth.",
          "priority": 2
        },
        {
          "h2": "Content: Share insights on vulnerability remediation",
          "body": [
            {
              "text": "Nick Fisher, VP of Marketing at Zafran, shared insights on LinkedIn about the company's approach to vulnerability management.",
              "claimIds": [
                "zaf-158",
                "zaf-167"
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "He noted that in a proof of value, \"96% of vulnerabilities didn’t require patching and can be mitigated using existing controls.\"",
              "claimIds": [
                "zaf-159",
                "zaf-167"
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "This perspective challenges traditional approaches by focusing on true exploitability and leveraging existing investments.",
              "claimIds": [
                "zaf-159",
                "zaf-167"
              ]
            }
          ],
          "sendLine": "On the landing page: Feature content based on Nick Fisher's LinkedIn post, explaining how Zafran's approach reveals that most vulnerabilities (96% in a PoV) can be mitigated with existing controls, challenging traditional patching strategies.",
          "priority": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "do_not_mention",
      "empty": false,
      "items": [
        {
          "h2": "Cisco strategic investment (July 2026) was not an acquisition",
          "body": [
            {
              "text": "While Cisco made a strategic investment in Zafran Security in July 2026, it was explicitly stated that this was not an acquisition.",
              "claimIds": [
                "zaf-135",
                "zaf-169"
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "Mentioning this as an acquisition would be inaccurate and could mislead prospects.",
              "claimIds": [
                "zaf-135",
                "zaf-169"
              ]
            }
          ],
          "priority": 1
        },
        {
          "h2": "Third-party claims of competitive struggles and high cash burn",
          "body": [
            {
              "text": "Industry reports from CTech and unnamed executives have raised questions about Zafran's competitive differentiation and high cash burn.",
              "claimIds": [
                "zaf-138",
                "zaf-170"
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "These claims could negatively impact perception and should be avoided in outreach.",
              "claimIds": [
                "zaf-138",
                "zaf-170"
              ]
            }
          ],
          "priority": 1
        },
        {
          "h2": "Co-founder Snir Havdala's departure to NVIDIA",
          "body": [
            {
              "text": "Co-founder and former CPO Snir Havdala reportedly departed Zafran Security to join NVIDIA.",
              "claimIds": [
                "zaf-142",
                "zaf-171"
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "While the company stated the departure was planned, it is best to avoid mentioning this to prevent any perception of instability.",
              "claimIds": [
                "zaf-142",
                "zaf-171"
              ]
            }
          ],
          "priority": 1
        },
        {
          "h2": "Amex Ventures investment amount not disclosed",
          "body": [
            {
              "text": "An investment from Amex Ventures was announced in February 2026, but the exact amount was not disclosed and was estimated by CTech to be several million dollars.",
              "claimIds": [
                "zaf-139"
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "As the specific figure is not confirmed, it's best to omit this detail from outreach.",
              "claimIds": [
                "zaf-139"
              ]
            }
          ],
          "priority": 2
        },
        {
          "h2": "Nick Fisher's cocktail hobby videos",
          "body": [
            {
              "text": "Nick Fisher hosts a YouTube channel called 'Cocktail Chemistry' as a side hobby, where he discusses cocktails and equipment.",
              "claimIds": [
                "zaf-100",
                "zaf-110",
                "zaf-160"
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "This content is unrelated to his professional role at Zafran Security and could be perceived as unprofessional if brought into business communications.",
              "claimIds": [
                "zaf-100",
                "zaf-110",
                "zaf-160"
              ]
            }
          ],
          "priority": 2
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
